   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2023-03-21",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The government’s mismanagement of the Financial Accountability Regime bills, including a deal with the Greens that was later reversed, delayed their passage, and it broke promises on tax and superannuation, such as doubling super taxes and taxing unrealised capital gains, while the Levy review on financial advice remains unanswered."
